00:02:17.865 --> 00:02:19.065
I'll put Dihydrate.

00:02:19.394 --> 00:02:23.775
Three would be Trihydrate, tetra,
hydrate, pentahydrate, hexa,

00:02:24.075 --> 00:02:27.825
